    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's time you learnt how to play.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>GAME</i> follows the story of a champion player of a cryptic and bizarre sport set in a vibrant and surreal world. Awoken at dawn one morning by your mother and shown the basics, you are thereafter thrust onto the path towards stardom\u2014whether you like it or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Told through a series of scenes spread throughout your life, equal parts funny and sad, <i>GAME </i>spans several decades and a wide variety of colorful and evocative locations. The dialogue choices you make with the characters you meet along the way will impact the  path your life takes, and the ultimate conclusion to your story.</p>",
